+
+        A local fsync spool can only protect updates after ``getUpdates`` has
+        delivered them.  Dropping the Bot API queue on a cold restart would
+        therefore create an unobservable gap in a supposedly continuous
+        archive.  Preserve upstream's cold-start cleanup for every other mode
+        and preserve pending updates for all reconnects as before.
+        """
